{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななせまる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/22/7058843/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントで、頑張ります、とかいっぱい見るので応援しています！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばってください写真。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金環日食"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グラスが手に入らず見れませんでした(ノ_・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リングの瞬間は生中継テレビで見たんですけどね、めっちゃ綺麗でしたね！！雲の流れのせいなのかリングの部分がキラキラ光ってるように見えた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ...乃木どこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うどんすごかったですね(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というかビデオはぜんぶ初めてみたやつで恥ずかしかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも番組で生誕祭なんかやってもらって本当に嬉しいですヽ(｡>▽<｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/22/7058843/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問にこたえる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●豆腐は木綿、絹ごし、どっちがすき？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツルツルしてる方しか食べられへん(ﾟ-ﾟ；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●どんな豆腐料理がすき？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷奴と豆腐サラダが美味しすぎます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、麻婆豆腐とか...忘れてはいけないおみそ汁！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●スニーカー派？ブーツ派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬はブーツばっかりかな。スニーカーは春と秋にちょこちょこ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし、絵を描いてきまーす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13個もどいやさんリクエストがためてある！一気に描こかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"}